      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL·07 Books sync: n8n side (lesson 6.4)\nThe books sync itself runs in MAKE (the accountant maintains it): every evening it reads paid orders from a read-only Supabase view and creates sales entries. Its last module POSTs a heartbeat here.\nEdge rules: secret header, fixed JSON shape, validate before trusting.\nContract: POST {\"workflow\":\"HL·07\",\"entries\":12,\"period\":\"2026-10-06\"} with header x-hl-secret.\n\n**Credentials:** Postgres (Supabase). **Environment:** HL_EDGE_SECRET.",
